WEBVTT

51:01.209 --> 51:02.794
As you will.

51:02.919 --> 51:06.173
- You can't mean it.
- A direwolf's no pet.

51:06.298 --> 51:08.425
Get her a dog.
She'll be happier for it.

51:09.718 --> 51:12.304
He doesn't mean Lady, does he?

51:12.429 --> 51:15.015
No, no, not Lady!
Lady didn't bite anyone!

51:15.140 --> 51:17.225
- She's good!
- Lady wasn't there!

51:17.351 --> 51:20.270
- You leave her alone!
- Stop them. Don't let them do it.

51:20.395 --> 51:22.773
Please, please, it wasn't Lady!

51:22.898 --> 51:24.608
Is this your command?

51:25.817 --> 51:27.235
Your Grace?
